<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Crane Co lowered to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Crane Co lowered to hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers Inc said Tuesday it had lowered its rating on Crane Co to hold from buy because the share price had risen above the firm's $40 price target.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We believe the shares are fairly valued at 16 times estimated 1998 earnings of $2.70 per share and the stock will be a market performer for the rest of 1997,&quot; analyst Donald Zwyer said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Crane's stock was off 3/4 at 42-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
